  "description": "A lightweight and flexible navigation library for WPF applications, inspired by Prism's RegionManager pattern. Supports multiple navigation hosts, view-viewmodel mapping, dependency injection, and both synchronous and asynchronous navigation lifecycle events with INavigationAware and IAsyncNavigationAware interfaces.",
